    "description": "来源：明日方舟游戏CG\r\n动效制作：agro（Vera_海月）\r\n背景音乐：Дом——塞壬唱片-MSR / Robert Wolf\r\n走过漫漫时空——塞壬唱片-MSR / Robert Wolf\r\nInnocence——塞壬唱片-MSR,ユリカリパブリック,松林凜\r\nInnocence (Instrumental)——塞壬唱片-MSR,松林凜\r\n\r\n17章活动页面的老猫非常好看，所以肝了动态壁纸！尽量在缩短制作时间内保持了一定的质量，若有什么想法请向我提出\r\n感谢您的订阅，喜欢的话请点个赞支持一下哦(=´▽｀)ゞ\r\n若壁纸有不足处或者运行问题欢迎大家指出！\r\n\r\n\r\nSource：Arknights\r\nDynamic production：agro（Vera_海月）\r\nBGM：Дом——塞壬唱片-MSR / Robert Wolf（Arknights Main EP.17 Lobby Theme）\r\n走过漫漫时空——塞壬唱片-MSR / Robert Wolf\r\nInnocence——塞壬唱片-MSR,ユリカリパブリック,松林凜\r\nInnocence (Instrumental)——塞壬唱片-MSR,松林凜\r\n\r\nKal'tsit from the Chapter 17 event page looks amazing, so I made a live wallpaper of it!I kept decent quality while trying to shorten the production time as much as possible.Feel free to share any ideas or suggestions you have.\r\nThank you for your subscription.If you like it, please leave a like to support me.(=´▽｀)ゞ\r\nIf there are any imperfections with the wallpaper or any operational issues, feel free to let me know!",
